  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIt does per spec (more explicitly after https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9994), but it doesn't match browser behavior prior to that change:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndata:text/html,<input type=range style=\"appearance: none; height: 3px\">\r\n```",
